<span id="A1.I2.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">R5: </span><span id="A1.I2.i5.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[0.87, 0.92, 0.91, 0.06]</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 3: Compute <span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">sigma_q_e</span> = entity score <math id="A1.p1.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-</annotation></semantics></math> ENR.<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.4.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
Examples:</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A1.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">R1: </span><math id="A1.I3.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[0.92-0.88,\ 0.95-0.88,\ 0.93-0.88,\ 0.01-0.88]=\texttt{[0.04, 0.07, 0.05, -0.87]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.92</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.88</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"> 0.95</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.88</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"> 0.93</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.88</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"> 0.01</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.88</mn></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathcolor="#000000">[0.04, 0.07, 0.05, -0.87]</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[0.92-0.88,\ 0.95-0.88,\ 0.93-0.88,\ 0.01-0.88]=\texttt{[0.04, 0.07, 0.05, -0.87]}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">R2: </span><math id="A1.I3.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[0.22-0.87,\ 0.45-0.87,\ 0.67-0.87,\ 0.01-0.87]=\texttt{[-0.65, -0.42, -0.20, -0.86]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.22</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.87</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"> 0.45</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.87</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"> 0.67</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.87</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"> 0.01</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.87</mn></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathcolor="#000000">[-0.65, -0.42, -0.20, -0.86]</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[0.22-0.87,\ 0.45-0.87,\ 0.67-0.87,\ 0.01-0.87]=\texttt{[-0.65, -0.42, -0.20, -0.86]}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 4: Per-record population variance (<math id="A1.p1.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{cf}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{cf}</annotation></semantics></math>).<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
We compute variance as the <em id="A1.p1.pic1.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">mean of squared deviations</em> (population variance, ddof <math id="A1.p1.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=0</annotation></semantics></math>).</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Examples (R1–R5):<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
