<span id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Mean </span><math id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">-0.1800</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<span id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Squared deviations: </span><span id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[0.03240000, 0.05290000, 0.04840000, 0.39690000]</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<span id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Population variance (R5) </span><math id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="A1.I4.i5.I1.i4.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">0.132650</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Across 5 records:</span></span>
<span id="A1.I5" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A1.I5.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I5.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I5.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I5.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{cf}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{cf}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I5.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> (before): </span><span id="A1.I5.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[0.159969, 0.061069, 0.029075, 0.140569, 0.132650]</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I5.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I5.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I5.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I5.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{cf}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{cf}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I5.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> (after): </span><span id="A1.I5.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[0.000069, 0.000069, 0.000069, 0.000069, 0.000069]</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 5: Bias Detection via Local–Global Fairness Quantification.<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
We detect biased instances using a convex combination of local sentence sensitivity and a global entity-bias prior.
For each entity <math id="A1.p1.pic1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">e</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e</annotation></semantics></math>, we estimate an <em id="A1.p1.pic1.2.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Entity Bias Volatility</em> <math id="A1.p1.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\theta}^{S}_{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">^</mo></mover><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">S</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\theta}^{S}_{n}</annotation></semantics></math> from the exploded <math id="A1.p1.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">σ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma</annotation></semantics></math> values:</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.Ex1" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\theta}^{S}_{n}\;=\;\tfrac{1}{2}\,\frac{\mathrm{q95}(|\sigma|)}{\max_{e^{\prime}}\mathrm{q95}(|\sigma|)}\;+\;\tfrac{1}{2}\,\frac{\mathrm{MAD}(\sigma)}{\max_{e^{\prime}}\mathrm{MAD}(\sigma)}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">^</mo></mover><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">S</mi></msubsup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.558em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">q95</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">σ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">max</mi><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">e</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">′</mo></msup></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">q95</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">σ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.502em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.502em">+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">MAD</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">σ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">max</mi><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">e</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">′</mo></msup></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">MAD</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">σ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\theta}^{S}_{n}\;=\;\tfrac{1}{2}\,\frac{\mathrm{q95}(|\sigma|)}{\max_{e^{\prime}}\mathrm{q95}(|\sigma|)}\;+\;\tfrac{1}{2}\,\frac{\mathrm{MAD}(\sigma)}{\max_{e^{\prime}}\mathrm{MAD}(\sigma)}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">With four entities (<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Blacks, Jews, Muslims, White people</span>), the global prior for a sentence is the mean EBV:</span></span>
<span id="A1.Ex2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta^{E}\;=\;\tfrac{1}{4}\sum_{e\in\{\text{blacks},\text{jews},\text{muslims},\text{white people}\}}\hat{\theta}^{S}_{n}\;=\;\mathbf{0.85962}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">E</mi></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.558em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="false"><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">4</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">e</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∈</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">blacks</mtext><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">jews</mtext><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">muslims</mtext><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">white people</mtext></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></munder><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">^</mo></mover><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">S</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="bold"> 0.85962</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta^{E}\;=\;\tfrac{1}{4}\sum_{e\in\{\text{blacks},\text{jews},\text{muslims},\text{white people}\}}\hat{\theta}^{S}_{n}\;=\;\mathbf{0.85962}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">We normalise the local dispersion as <math id="A1.p1.pic1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\theta}_{cf}=\min(\theta_{cf},\,0.25)/0.25\in[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">^</mo></mover><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi></mrow></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi></mrow></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"> 0.25</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">/</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.25</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">∈</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\theta}_{cf}=\min(\theta_{cf},\,0.25)/0.25\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math> and combine with weight <math id="A1.p1.pic1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda=0.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">λ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda=0.5</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></span>
<span id="A1.Ex3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{n}=0.5\,\hat{\theta}^{S}_{n}+0.5\theta^{E}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">R</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.5</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">^</mo></mover><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">S</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">E</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{n}=0.5\,\hat{\theta}^{S}_{n}+0.5\theta^{E}.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Using <math id="A1.p1.pic1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{\mathrm{n}}=0.35" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">R</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.35</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{\mathrm{n}}=0.35</annotation></semantics></math>, an instance is flagged for mitigation if <math id="A1.p1.pic1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R\geq R_{\mathrm{n}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">R</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">≥</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">R</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R\geq R_{\mathrm{n}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span>
<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Per-record calculations (R1–R5):<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.12.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.I6" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A1.I6.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I6.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I6.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I6.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">R1:</span><span id="A1.I6.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><math id="A1.I6.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{cf}=0.159969\Rightarrow\hat{\theta}_{cf}=0.639875" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi></mrow></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.159969</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">^</mo></mover><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi></mrow></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.639875</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{cf}=0.159969\Rightarrow\hat{\theta}_{cf}=0.639875</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I6.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">;  </span><math id="A1.I6.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R=\tfrac{1}{2}(0.639875)+\tfrac{1}{2}(0.85962)=\mathbf{0.749747}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">R</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.639875</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.85962</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathcolor="#000000" mathvariant="bold">0.749747</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R=\tfrac{1}{2}(0.639875)+\tfrac{1}{2}(0.85962)=\mathbf{0.749747}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I6.i1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">  (</span><span id="A1.I6.i1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">mitigate</span><span id="A1.I6.i1.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">)</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I6.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I6.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I6.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I6.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">R2:</span><span id="A1.I6.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><math id="A1.I6.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{cf}=0.061069\Rightarrow\hat{\theta}_{cf}=0.244275" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi></mrow></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.061069</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">⇒</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">^</mo></mover><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi></mrow></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0.244275</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{cf}=0.061069\Rightarrow\hat{\theta}_{cf}=0.244275</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I6.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">;  </span><math id="A1.I6.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R=\tfrac{1}{2}(0.244275)+\tfrac{1}{2}(0.85962)=\mathbf{0.551947}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">R</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" 