<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 6: Sentence Fairness Variance (SFV).<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.13.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
SFV summarises the sentence-level instability across entities by taking the <em id="A1.p1.pic1.2.13.1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">mean</em> and <em id="A1.p1.pic1.2.13.1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">population variance</em> (ddof <math id="A1.p1.pic1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=0</annotation></semantics></math>) of the five per-record <math id="A1.p1.pic1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{cf}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{cf}</annotation></semantics></math> values.</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Before mitigation:<span id="A1.p1.pic1.2.14.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.I7" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A1.I7.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A1.I7.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I7.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.I7.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{cf}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">θ</mi><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">f</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{cf}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I7.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> values:
</span><span id="A1.I7.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[0.159969, 0.061069, 0.029075, 0.140569, 0.132650]</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I7.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
